  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Frosted Glass over Teal-Lavender Mist",
    "overview": "SIMUTU is a daily working tool for quality-assurance staff, leadership, auditors, lecturers and students. Its world is a pale mist that drifts from mint-teal at the top left to lavender at the right and bottom corners, fixed behind the content while it scrolls. Every surface sitting on that mist is a translucent, blurred glass panel with a bright one-pixel white edge and a soft, offset teal-tinted shadow. Deep teal is the one voice of action: the primary button, the active navigation pill, and the dashboard/login banner. Violet, pink, orange, sky and teal appear only as small gradient icon chips and data encodings, never as surface fills.\n\nThe build rejects the flat admin dashboard (grey page, flat white cards, dark sidebar) in favour of a light, calm workspace. Density stays high: KPI tiles, tables, meters and charts sit side by side at 14px body text. Ink is dark teal, never black. The world is light-only; there is no dark mode.\n\nAccessibility shaped the palette. Every text tone was darkened until it clears WCAG AA against the thinnest glass (primary text, muted text, danger, violet and orange inks all have their own deeper \"ink\" token), and the banner teal was taken darker than first planned so white text holds.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Fixed multi-radial mist background; glass surfaces float on it with blur, a white edge and a soft teal shadow.",
      "Gradient everywhere: primary buttons, active pill, banners, meters, chips and soft status badges are all gentle two-stop gradients.",
      "One deep-teal action colour; accent hues are confined to icon chips, badges and charts.",
      "Dark teal ink with separate AA-safe ink tokens for each tinted tone.",
      "Generous roundness (14px base, 22px cards, 24px banners, pill badges).",
      "Plus Jakarta Sans throughout, extrabold for numbers and headings, tabular figures for data."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Teal Voice Rule",
        "body": "Deep teal gradient marks action and \"you are here\": primary buttons, the active navigation pill, banners. Never use it as a card or section fill.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Ink Pair Rule",
        "body": "Every tinted tone has a fill token and a separate darker ink token. Text on a tint always uses the ink (success-ink, warm-orange-ink, violet-ink, danger-ink), never the fill hue itself.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Apricot-Only-on-Teal Rule",
        "body": "On the banner teal, text is white or white at 85%, and the single highlight colour is Banner Apricot.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Token-Only Color Rule",
        "body": "Components never carry hex or rgb literals. Every colour, gradient and shadow is a `:root` token exposed through a theme colour or utility; a new colour needs a named token first.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tabular Numbers Rule",
        "body": "Scores, counts, percentages and dates in data displays use tabular figures so columns and meters align.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Uppercase Is Navigation Rule",
        "body": "Tracked uppercase belongs only to sidebar group headings. Page and card headings stay in sentence case.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two Glass Weights Rule",
        "body": "Resting content uses thin glass (46% → 26% white, card shadow). Anything that floats above content uses strong glass (95% → 86% white, float shadow). There is no third opacity.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Button Radius Rule",
        "body": "All buttons share the 18px radius regardless of size; sizes change height and padding, never the corner.",
        "section": "shapes"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** put every content surface on thin glass (46% → 26% white, 22px blur, 1px white edge, card shadow) over the fixed mist background.",
      "**Do** use the action-teal gradient only for primary actions, the active navigation pill and \"good\" meters; use action-teal (#07505a) for teal text and icons.",
      "**Do** pair every tinted fill with its ink token for text (success-ink, warm-orange-ink, violet-ink, danger-ink) to hold 4.5:1.",
      "**Do** use the validated categorical order chart-1 → chart-5, the teal seq ramp for magnitude, and the coral ↔ teal diverging ramp for Likert distributions.",
      "**Do** keep input borders at input-stroke so fields stay ≥3:1 on glass.",
      "**Do** add a named `:root` token before using any new colour, gradient or shadow in a component.",
      "**Do** switch focus rings to white on the banner teal.",
      "**Do** honour reduced motion: keep fades, drop scale, slide and width animations."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** return to the flat admin look: grey page, flat white cards, dark sidebar.",
      "**Don't** use pure black text; ink is teal-ink.",
